msgstr "экземпляр метода :class:`litegram.methods.send_photo.SendPhoto`"

#: litegram.types.chat_join_request.ChatJoinRequest.answer_poll:1
#: litegram.types.chat_join_request.ChatJoinRequest.answer_poll_pm:1 of
